        "\n",
        "def generate_topic_list(course):\n",
        "\n",
        "    prompt = f\"\"\"\n",
        "You are an AI curriculum designer, similar to how W3Schools structures a\n",
        "tutorial menu.\n",
        "\n",
        "Create an ordered list of 8 to 12 topic titles that together teach the\n",
