        "   tutorial menu.\n",
        "2. Each topic title must be short (3 to 6 words).\n",
        "3. Cover the course from fundamentals to more advanced sub-topics.\n",
        "4. Return ONLY a valid JSON array of strings.\n",
        "5. Do not include markdown.\n",
        "6. Do not include any extra text.\n",
        "\"\"\"\n",
        "\n",
        "    try:\n",
        "        response = client.chat(\n",
        "            model=\"mistral-small-latest\",\n",
